    "title": "Modify an action with 地",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-adverbial-di-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Modify an action with 地",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "的 links a description to a noun. 地 can link a manner before an action; in familiar concise expressions such as 认真看书, it may naturally be omitted. 得 introduces a description after the action. Choose by function, not just by their shared pronunciation de.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "认真的人",
                "pinyin": "rènzhēn de rén",
                "meaning": "A conscientious person.",
                "audio": "6819c7ea420add1e44776a21c10c50e77e9ec0ec7c559c90f31ffee7d6fbf32d"
              },
              {
                "text": "他认真地看书。",
                "pinyin": "tā rènzhēn de kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "He reads carefully.",
                "audio": "adfca7e971e02accc070a95a7865def47ca75d1755e95b12a7b628d9f80471eb"
              },
              {
                "text": "他认真看书。",
